>term stripLeadingAndTrailingWhitespace = (λs.strings.fromList (lists.dropWhile chars.isSpace (lists.reverse (lists.dropWhile chars.isSpace (lists.reverse (strings.toList s))))))@{description="Remove leading and trailing whitespace from a string"}
